Error [E2307]: `view` cannot be used directly here without an owning copy
  --> erased_memory_policy_and_bounds_facts_do_not_escape_2.jet:10:14
    |
 10 |         need(view)
    |              ^^^^
 Why: `view` is a zero-copy view into `source` (`.trim()`/`.after()`/`.before()`); this destination needs an owned `String`, and `copies: .Explicit` keeps the implicit materialization disabled
 Fix: Write `~view` first, or remove `copies: .Explicit` to use the default owning copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2307
